# Hand That Feeds with three card types in Bot1's graveyard, one short of delirium (CR 207.2c): Black Lotus (artifact), Wheel
# of Fortune (sorcery) and an Ornithopter (artifact creature) are artifact, sorcery and creature. Attacking on turn 3 it does
# not trigger: it stays a 2/2 without menace, so Bot2's Ornithopter (0/2) blocks it and dies to its 2 damage, and Bot2's life stays 20.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Black Lotus
Wheel of Fortune
Ornithopter
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Hand That Feeds
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x7
Ornithopter
Island x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
